sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as FactsRouter
    participant S as FactService
    participant Repo as FactRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: 简化后的 Fact 创建流程（无版本链）

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/facts (CreateFactRequest)
    R->>S: create(CreateFactCommand)
    S->>S: 校验 fact_type 合法
    S->>S: 幂等检查（idempotency_key）

    alt 幂等命中
        S->>Repo: find_by_idempotency_key(org_id, key)
        Repo->>DB: SELECT FROM fact WHERE org_id AND idempotency_key
        DB-->>Repo: existing Fact
        Repo-->>S: Fact
        S-->>R: FactRef(fact_id, fact_type, subject_id, status)
    else 新建
        S->>S: 校验 template_version_id 已发布
        S->>S: 校验 object_id 属于组织
        S->>S: 校验 method_version_id 已发布（可选）
        S->>Repo: insert_fact(org_id, template_version_id, fact_type, object_id, subject_id, method_version_id, flow_run_id, started_at, ended_at, task_code, task_name, department_name, operator, run_operator, equipment_name, status, idempotency_key, created_by)
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO fact (...)
        DB-->>Repo: Fact ORM
        Repo-->>S: Fact
        S-->>R: FactRef(fact_id, fact_type, subject_id, status)
    end

    R-->>C: 201 FactResponse(fact_id, fact_type, subject_id, status)

    Note over C,DB: 简化后的 Fact 搜索流程

    C->>R: GET /api/v1/facts/search?q=粒度
    R->>S: search(query, filters, cursor, page_size)
    S->>Repo: search_facts(query, org_id, filters, cursor, page_size)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT FROM fact WHERE search_vector @@ tsquery AND org_id AND filters ORDER BY created_at
    DB-->>Repo: rows
    Repo-->>S: [FactRef, next_cursor]
    S-->>R: [FactRef, next_cursor]
    R-->>C: FactListResponse(items, next_cursor)

    Note over C,DB: 简化后的 Fact 详情获取流程

    C->>R: GET /api/v1/facts/{fact_id}
    R->>S: get(fact_id)
    S->>Repo: get_fact(fact_id, org_id)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT FROM fact WHERE id AND org_id
    DB-->>Repo: Fact
    Repo-->>S: Fact
    S-->>R: FactRef(fact_id, fact_type, subject_id, status)
    R-->>C: FactResponse(fact_id, fact_type, subject_id, status, task_code, ...)
